    {
      "id": 911,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 18,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Video: a new clip on the edges of your clip with Wan 2.2 Fun Control",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Video: a new clip on the edges of your clip with Wan 2.2 Fun Control\n\nDraws the edges of every frame of your clip with Canny and renders a new clip on them with Wan 2.2 Fun Control A14B, so the motion of your clip holds. Built from Comfy's template video_wan2_2_14B_fun_control.\n\n## Models\n\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors): umt5-xxl text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/google/umt5-xxl).\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged).\n- [wan2.2_fun_control_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_control_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Wan 2.2 Fun Control A14B, high noise, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control).\n- [wan2.2_fun_control_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_control_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Wan 2.2 Fun Control A14B, low noise, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
